<p t="0" d="2500" wp="1" ws="1"><s p="2">Chapter one</s></p>
<p t="2500" d="3000" p="1" wp="2" ws="1">The ferry leaves at noon.</p>
<p t="5500" d="3200" wp="2" ws="1"><s p="1">Tickets cost </s><s p="2">four euros</s><s p="1">.</s></p>
<p t="8700" d="2800" wp="3" ws="1"><s p="3">Pier 3 &amp;#39;North&amp;#39;</s></p>
<p t="11500" d="3000">Please keep
